{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Parlor Car|Although it is not a request to formally join the Express Crew, a former opponent's request to travel alongside you is still worthy of due consideration. That being said... You would really enjoy having a junior you can bully&mdash; you mean give guidance to.}}
