:'''Sunday:''' I learn the most valuable lessons from my past opponents. Please say whatever's on your mind.
:'''(Trailblazer):''' ...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You are a noble person.
::'''(Trailblazer):''' You're a noble person. I can't deny that you always have compassion in your heart, even though we may view things differently.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You always want to be in control.
::'''(Trailblazer):''' You're a perfectionist, always trying to control everything &mdash; even when it comes to yourself. Although, we're going to be traveling further into the unknown once we leave Penacony. I guess a change of pace could do everyone some good.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You've disappointed many people.
::'''(Trailblazer):''' You know what I'm going to say. Tons of people trusted you, but you let them all down &mdash; even your closest family. Don't you forget that.
:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I agree with what you stand for.
::'''(Trailblazer):''' I believe there is a way &mdash; a better way &mdash; to achieve your ideal. Seven rest days may be just a metaphor... But I look forward to the day when it comes true.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Have some hope in humanity.
::'''(Trailblazer):''' Maybe you're too pessimistic about humanity, but the Trailblaze isn't like that. We had to learn to have faith before embarking on this path. You must do the same.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You have an unrealistic ideal.
::'''(Trailblazer):''' Ideals are good to have, but nothing good comes from getting carried away in fantasies. I can never agree with how you dragged everyone into that world of yours just to fulfill an illusory dream.
:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We can be friends.
::'''(Trailblazer):''' Nothing is for certain, anyway. An enemy yesterday may be a friend today.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're a worthy adversary.
::'''(Trailblazer):''' Anyhow, you've been an unforgettable adversary to me, even though I haven't been trailblazing for long...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't agree with Mr. Yang...
::'''(Trailblazer):''' In any case, I'm gonna have to disagree with Mr. Yang...
:{{tx}}
